    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im having a major issue at our plant. we are running sublimation prints on polyester blends but the color transfer is super inconsistent. some areas look vibrant but others are really faded or just don't show up at all. we are using a heat press. what should i be checking first regarding the machine settings?",
